{#-
  OpenVDM lowering README template (Jinja2, https://jinja.palletsprojects.com/).

  The installer copies this file to server/etc/lowering_readme.md.j2 when
  that doesn't exist yet; edit the copy (or set loweringReadme.template in
  openvdm.yaml) to change the README. OpenVDM uses this .dist file while
  there's no copy. The variables are described in
  build_lowering_readme_context() in server/lib/readme.py. The README is
  rebuilt whenever the lowering config is exported: Setup New Lowering,
  Finalize Lowering and Export Lowering Config, and by the Rebuild the
  Lowering README task.
-#}
# Lowering {{ lowering.loweringID }}{% if cruise.cruiseID %} (cruise {{ cruise.cruiseID }}){% endif %}


This directory holds the data collected during lowering {{ lowering.loweringID }}{% if cruise.cruiseID %} of cruise {{ cruise.cruiseID }}{% if cruise.cruiseName %} ({{ cruise.cruiseName }}){% endif %}{% endif %}{% if vessel.name %} aboard {{ vessel.name }}{% endif %}, organized by OpenVDM (Open Vessel Data Management).

## Lowering

{% if lowering.loweringStartDate or lowering.loweringEndDate %}
- **Dates:** {{ lowering.loweringStartDate or "?" }} to {{ lowering.loweringEndDate or "?" }}
{% endif %}
{% if lowering.loweringExtent %}
- **Extent:** {{ lowering.loweringExtent.westernmost }} to {{ lowering.loweringExtent.easternmost }} longitude, {{ lowering.loweringExtent.southernmost }} to {{ lowering.loweringExtent.northernmost }} latitude (decimal degrees)
{% endif %}
{% if vessel.name %}
- **Vessel:** {{ vessel.name }}
{% endif %}
{% if vessel.contact and (vessel.contact.institution or vessel.contact.email) %}
- **Contact:** {{ [vessel.contact.institution, vessel.contact.email] | select | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}

## Directory layout
Paths are relative to this directory.
{# Each line of a description ends in two spaces, a Markdown line break, so
   its Source/Contents, Files and Sub-directories lines (#449) stay apart #}

### `{{ files.readme }}`: this file.
### `{{ files.lowering_config }}`: the lowering's OpenVDM configuration (JSON): the lowering details above and the directory layout.

This directory is `{{ files.lowering_dir }}/` in the cruise directory{% if cruise.cruiseID %} of {{ cruise.cruiseID }}{% endif %}. These files there also cover it:

- `{{ files.md5_summary }}`: the MD5 checksum of every file in the cruise directory, this lowering's included.
{% if files.data_dashboard_manifest %}
- `{{ files.data_dashboard_manifest }}`: the list of the files behind OpenVDM's Data Dashboard for this lowering.
{% endif %}

